---
---

<section
  id="summary"
  class="py-16 lg:py-20 border-t scroll-mt-[80px] w-full"
  style="border-color:var(--border);"
>
  <div class="w-full flex flex-col items-center text-center mb-10">
    <h2 class="text-[28px] lg:text-[34px] tracking-[-0.03em] font-bold leading-[0.95] text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto w-full">
      Summary
    </h2>
    <div class="mt-4 mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--text-faint)] text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto w-full">
      Custom WordPress development, 10+ years
    </div>
  </div>
  <div
    class="rounded-[24px] border p-6 md:p-8 w-full"
    style="background:var(--card);border-color:var(--border);"
  >
    <p class="text-[15px] lg:text-[16px] leading-[1.7] text-[var(--text-muted)]">
      Senior WordPress Developer with 10+ years building, scaling, and
      maintaining production WordPress & Magento websites. 
    </p>
    <p class="text-[15px] lg:text-[16px] leading-[1.7] text-[var(--text-muted)] mt-2">
      At PT Sebangsa Bersama, I developed and maintained three live platforms (SebangsaNetwork.com, Komunita.id, Support.Arena.id): shipping features, patching security issues, and releasing through a Git workflow.
    </p>
    <p class="text-[15px] lg:text-[16px] leading-[1.7] text-[var(--text-muted)] mt-2">
      I've worked remotely, building custom themes and plugins, optimizing WooCommerce stores, and handling technical SEO (GSC/GA4). 
    </p>
    <p class="text-[15px] lg:text-[16px] leading-[1.7] text-[var(--text-muted)] mt-2">
      I’ve also reviewed code and coordinated developers through Git and Asana. Looking for a long-term team where I can build custom WordPress and keep Core Web Vitals fast.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2 justify-start md:justify-start">
      <span
        class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-[11px] mono border"
        style="border-color:var(--border);background:var(--bg-soft);"
      >
        Team Collaboration
      </span>
      <span
        class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-[11px] mono border"
        style="border-color:var(--border);background:var(--bg-soft);"
      >
        Architecture
      </span>
      <span
        class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-[11px] mono border"
        style="border-color:var(--border);background:var(--bg-soft);"
      >
        Code Review
      </span>
      <span
        class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-[11px] mono border"
        style="border-color:var(--primary);background:rgba(255,140,26,0.12);color:var(--primary);"
      >
        Open to Remote or Hybrid Work • EU/US Overlap
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
